    "body": "Scope record for PR #3684. Maintainer decision (owner's standing word 2026-11-22: choose recommended while he sleeps): the PR closes this issue, and each open item of \"Done means\" has its own issue.\n\n- Each level enters at most one stepdown below the floor: PR #3684 does this for tab window 0. The other tab windows, and window 0 with the stay-down ramp preset, are #3678.\n- Verify names a plunge deeper than one stepdown: #3679.\n- A tab hop rises only to the tab top plus a clearance: #3685.\n\nOptions: (a) close this issue with the PR and track the rest in the three issues (taken; the commit body has the closing line and a force-push is not permitted); (b) keep this issue open as an umbrella (dropped: one issue for each defect is easier to pick).\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
