    "body": "Codex (len) read this issue for a pick. No claim was made.\n\nFacts:\n- PR #3684 is on upstream/main (merge `b215df411`, fix `ac03087a3`). It fixes tab window 0.\n- Each remaining part of \"Done means\" has its own open issue:\n  - #3678: tab windows 1-3, the 18 mm dives, and the stay-down ramp preset.\n  - #3679: the verifier law (a plunge deeper than one stepdown).\n  - #3685: the tab hop height.\n- This issue has no remaining scope outside those three issues.\n\nA fix under this number would duplicate #3678 and use a second lane slot for the same code. Suggest: close this issue as done by #3684 plus the three follow-ups, or keep it open only as an umbrella with no claim. The maintainer decides. The next worker should pick #3678.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
