    "body": "Codex (m3) read this issue for a pick. No claim was made.\n\nLooks already fixed on upstream/main. Each part of \"Done means\" now has a merged fix or its own open issue:\n\n- Tab window 0 enters in the kerf of the level above: PR #3684 (merge `b215df411`).\n- Tab windows 1-3 and the 18 mm dives: #3678, closed by PR #3866 (merge `4b5cb0d2d`).\n- The verifier refuses a feed plunge deeper than one stepdown into uncut material: #3679, closed by PR #3847 (merge `afadbf4eb`).\n- The tab hop height: #3685 is open (P7, enhancement). It tracks this part.\n\nA fix under this number would duplicate #3685. Suggest closing this issue as done by #3684, #3866 and #3847, with #3685 for the tab hop. The maintainer decides.\n",
